---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-weave border-t border-ink/10 bg-paper-2">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
		<div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Plumbline Studio</p>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-ink-soft">
					Full-service interior design for primary residences, historic restorations, and vacation
					homes, based in a converted tobacco warehouse in Scott&rsquo;s Addition.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint">Visit</p>
				<p>3204 Norfolk Street, Suite 2</p>
				<p>Richmond, VA 23230</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="tel:+18045550176" class="hover:text-navy">(804) 555-0176</a>
				</p>
				<p><a href="mailto:studio@plumblinestudio.com" class="hover:text-navy">studio@plumblinestudio.com</a></p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint">By Appointment</p>
				<p>Mon&ndash;Fri &nbsp; 9a&ndash;5p</p>
				<p>Sat&ndash;Sun &nbsp; Reserved for install days</p>
				<p class="mt-3 text-ink-faint">Studio visits and material library by appointment only.</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-navy"
						>@plumbline.studio</a
					>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="my-8 h-px bg-ink/10"></div>

		<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-ink-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
			<p>&copy; {year} Plumbline Studio, PLLC</p>
			<p>Concept site by Noel Ngerem &middot; not a real business</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
